    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Madagascar",
            "zh": "马达加斯加"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", farmers have "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "cut down",
            "ref": "v-cut-down"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " large areas of the rainforest. They did this to make more farmland for growing food. Some bats used to live in this rainforest. After the trees were "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", the bats did not fly away to a new home. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", they now live in the few trees that are left nearby. Every night, they fly out to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "forage",
            "zh": "觅食"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "crop fields",
            "zh": "庄稼地"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Ricardo Rocha is an "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "ecologist",
            "ref": "v-ecologist"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He wanted to know how these bats were "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the environment there. To "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", he and his team went to the fields at night. They carefully "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " some bats with special nets. They were very "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "gentle",
            "ref": "v-gentle"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They collected the animals’ "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "poop",
            "zh": "粪便"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and then set them "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Back in the lab, the team "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "analysed",
            "ref": "v-analyse"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the poop to find out what the bats were eating."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The results were "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Rocha’s team found that the animals were eating many harmful "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "pests",
            "ref": "v-pest"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This means that the bats are actually helping the farmers. They keep the crops "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and help farmers produce more food. The bats also eat insects that can "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "spread diseases",
            "ref": "v-spread-disease"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to humans, which helps keep people healthy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Now, Rocha is sharing these important findings with local farmers. He teaches them about all the good things bats bring. He hopes that once farmers understand this, they will stop "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " more trees. That way, bats and many other animals can be better protected and "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to live in the area."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
